/span><span style=\"color:#000\"> directory</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;/var/run/cloudera-scm-agent/process/ccdeploy_revo-conf_etcRevolutionconf.cloudera.mro_config_-8972978723460285379/revo-conf/__cloudera_metadata__&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div>Actually the folder revo-conf does not exists in the path /var/run/cloudera-scm-agent/process/ccdeploy_revo-conf_etcRevolutionconf.cloudera.mro_config_-8972978723460285379 .</div><div>Any idea how to solve this issue?</div><div>Thank you,</div><div>Leonardo</div></div>"
